(#$commutativeInArgs REL 1 2) means that the first and second
arguments to REL are commutative, but not necessarily the third
or greater argument positions.  (#$commutativeInArgs REL 2 3 5)
means that the second, third, and fifth argument positions of REL
are commutative, but not necessarily the first, fourth, or any positions
greater than the fifth.
