after a truck bomb levels Saudi Aramco corporate headquarters in
Dharan, a van runs a Saudi roadblock ten miles from an oil pumping
station in the Eastern Province.  The van explodes as the Saudi
soldiers move in, and five suspected terrorists traveling in the van
are killed, leaving no survivors.  This constant stands for the driver
of the van in that attack.  These events occur in the second stage of
the HPKB Crisis Scenario.")
