(distributesOutOfArg <reln> <pred> <n>) denotes that the canonicalizer

will translate

(<pred> <arg-1> ... <arg-n-1> (<reln> <arg-n1> <arg-n2> ... <arg-nm>) <arg-n+1> ..) 

