only right-hand turns one will travel along ST1, ST2, ST3, and
ST4, in that order.  The region immediately surrounding the 
block must be an #$UrbanArea that has a #$GridStreetSystem
running through it.  To have this function return a specific
desired city BLOCK, one can fill its arg1 position with any 
of the four streets that borders BLOCK, and then continue
to fill in the remaining argument-places according to the
order in which one would travel along the other three streets
if one were circling BLOCK in a clockwise fashion (i.e. by 
making only right-hand turns).  See also #$CityGridSectionFn.")
)

