Note that X and Y should rarely be instances of #$Entity.  In fact, Doug has only been acqainted with Madonna since 1983, so we should write (#$holdsIn (#$TimeIntervalInclusiveFn (#$YearFn 1983) #$Now) (#$acquaintances #$Lenat Madonna #$TrueFanAcquaintance)).")
